Error [E0711]: the `Abilities` handle `caps` can't escape its `#Abilities` block
  --> tests/ui/grant_handle_escapes.jet:6:18
    |
  6 |         alias :: caps
    |                  ^^^^
 Why: `#Abilities(…)` revokes the `Abilities` at the end of its block (RAII); returning, storing, or sharing `caps` would let revoked rights outlive the scope
 Fix: use `caps` only inside the `#Abilities` block, or perform the work there
